Neutralize the two pre-existing compile errors on this tree, so the backend
fixtures for the GitHub issue intake can be executed.

Both references were introduced by a15fdcf9 ("fix(remote): describe every live
session and publish desktop focus") and are missing from every branch of this
repository: `DaemonSessionService::project_desktop_gui_session` is defined
nowhere, and `SpawnRequestFingerprint` has no `requested_session_id` field.
Nothing in the issue-intake slice touches `daemon/`, so the module under test is
byte-identical to the committed one once this patch is applied.

Apply from the repository root:

    git apply docs/evidence/github-issue-intake-20261006/preexisting-daemon-breakage.patch

